00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:46.042
- [Nurses] Hi!

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.670
- First of all, I adore
Darcey, her whole family.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.860
They were all there, I kind
of got to see everybody.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.070
Oh my gosh. What a beautiful little girl.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.670
She's so great.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.390
- She's amazing. Yes.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:00.090
We met her a little over a year ago

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:02.470
when she started her
treatment here with us.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.760
And I don't know how
you can know Darcey and

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.760
not fall in love with her.
She's just a sweetheart.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.140
She's always in a charming mood.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.070
She's just an incredible person.

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.000
And even on her worst days,

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.390
her hardest days of treatment,

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:18.940
she's always smiling and in a happy mood,

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:21.660
we're just so fortunate to know her.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:23.680
And she's just an
inspiration to all of us here

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.980
and everyone who is fortunate
enough to know her as well.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.960
- Yes, she has got such a beautiful smile.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:29.840
And I got to know like,

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.410
how did the music video come together?

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:32.990
She asked you all to be in it?

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:36.270
- Yes. So when she asks us
to be a part of the video,

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.760
we just knew that we had to
make it extra special for her.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.220
I've been a pediatric nurse
since before I had children

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.430
of my own. They are now
four and two years old.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:50.090
And when I see the challenges
that Darcey is facing,

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:53.410
I just can't help, but
think of them as well.

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:56.670
So whenever she asks us to
be a part of this video,

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:58.270
we try to make it extra special.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:00.320
So we actually had these shirts made

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.240
- [Kelly] Yeah!
- and we surprised Darcey

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:04.550
