(audience clapping)

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:07.553
So her mom was actually the
one who recorded the video,

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:11.950
and when she played it back
to us, we were just so amazed.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:14.950
I mean, you can see
her passion for dancing

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.040
and for singing with
all of her expressions

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:21.130
and her dance moves and
it just meant the world

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:23.694
to the four of us to see her so happy.

00:02:23.694 --> 00:02:26.960
And that was our goal
just to make her happy.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:30.550
And I think we achieved it
and we were just so honored

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.070
to have been a part of this.

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:34.520
- Well it's so special, y'all.
(audience clapping)

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.130
It's such a scary time
I can only imagine for

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.050
