y'all have some kids too,

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.340
like just for her to
be in that, that space,

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.867
it's such a hard space
to, for anyone to be in,

00:02:42.867 --> 00:02:45.380
let alone a child and to do this for her,

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:46.540
it's such a beautiful thing, so

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.520
I wanted to bring you on
here, bring on the show

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.450
because I know she loves y'all so much.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.480
And I didn't get a chance
to say hi to y'all,

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.910
when I talked to Darcey,
so thank y'all so much.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:54.790
It's so cool.
(clapping)

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:55.980
Y'all did with her.
(clapping)

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:59.180
And also thank you so much for

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.340
